"facultate","fah-kool-TAH-teh"]]},{"id":"school-verbs","title":"School verbs","items":[["to study","a studia","ah stoo-DEE-ah"],["to teach","a preda","ah preh-DAH"],["to ask","a întreba","ah uhn-treh-BAH"],["to answer","a răspunde","ah ruh-SPOON-deh"],["to repeat","a repeta","ah reh-peh-TAH"],["to understand","a înțelege","ah uhn-tseh-LEH-jeh"],["to remember","a-și aminti","ah-sheeah-meen-TEE"],["to forget","a uita","ah oo-ee-TAH"],["to explain","a explica","ah eks-plee-KAH"],["to practise","a exersa","ah ek-ser-SAH"],["to pass an exam","a trece un examen","ah TREH-cheh oon ek-ZAH-men"],["to fail an exam","a pica un examen","ah PEE-kah oon ek-ZAH-men"],["to write down","a nota","ah noh-TAH"],["to listen","a asculta","ah ahs-kool-TAH"],["to read aloud","a citi cu voce tare","ah chee-TEE koo VOH-cheh TAH-reh"],["to think","a gândi","ah guhn-DEE"],["to count","a număra","ah noo-muh-RAH"],["to spell","a silabisi","ah see-lah-bee-SEE"],["to translate","a traduce","ah trah-DOO-cheh"],["to graduate","a absolvi","ah ahb-sohl-VEE"]]}],"grammar":[{"id":"pronouns","title":"Pronouns","text":["Romanian often drops the pronoun, because the verb ending shows who is speaking. \"El\" is he, \"ea\" is she. \"Tu\" is informal and \"dumneavoastră\" is very formal."],"rows":[["I","eu","eh-oo"],["you (informal)","tu","too"],["he / she / it","el / ea","el / yah"],["we","noi","noy"],["you (formal or plural)","voi / dumneavoastră","voy / doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"],["they","ei / ele","ey / EH-leh"]],"ex":[["I am a student","eu sunt student","eh-oo soont stoo-DENT"],["you are tall","tu ești înalt","too esht uh-NAHLT"],["she is my older sister","ea este sora mea mai mare","yah YES-teh SOH-rah myah my MAH-reh"],["we are friends","noi suntem prieteni","noy soon-TEM pree-eh-TEN"],["they are teachers","ei sunt profesori","ey soont proh-feh-SOR"]]},{"id":"singular-and-plural","title":"Singular and plural","text":["The plural endings change the last letters: -e, -i, -uri. carte, cărți. casă, case. copil, copii."],"rows":[["carte (book)","cărți","kuhrts"],["casă (house)","case","KAH-seh"],["copil (child)","copii","koh-PEE"],["pisică (cat)","pisici","pee-SEECH"]],"ex":[["one house, houses","o casă, case","oh KAH-suh KAH-seh"],["one book, books","o carte, cărți","oh KAR-teh kuhrts"],["one cat, cats","o pisică, pisici","oh pee-SEE-kuh pee-SEECH"],["two books","două cărți","DOH-uh kuhrts"],["the children","copiii","koh-PEE-ee"]]},{"id":"to-be-a-fi","title":"To be: a fi","text":["\"A fi\" (to be) is irregular. Learn all the forms. The pronoun is usually dropped."],"rows":[["I am","sunt","soont"],["you are","ești","esht"],["he / she is","este","YES-teh"],["we are","suntem","soon-TEM"],["you are (formal)","sunteți","soon-TETS"],["they are","sunt","soont"]],"ex":[["I am a student","sunt student","soont stoo-DENT"],["you are tired","ești obosit","esht oh-boh-SEET"],["he is a doctor","el este medic","el YES-teh MEH-deek"],["we are happy","suntem fericiți","soon-TEM feh-ree-CHEETS"],["they are at home","sunt acasă","soont ah-KAH-suh"]]},{"id":"a-avea-have","title":"A avea: have","text":["\"A avea\" (to have): am, ai, are, avem, aveți, au."],"rows":[["I have","am","ahm"],["you have","ai","eye"],["he / she has","are","AH-reh"],["we have","avem","ah-VEM"],["you have (formal)","aveți","ah-VETS"],["they have","au","ah-oo"]],"ex":[["I have an older brother","am un frate mai mare","ahm oon FRAH-teh my MAH-reh"],["I have a car","am o mașină","ahm oh mah-SHEE-nuh"],["I do not have time","nu am timp","noo ahm teemp"],["there is a problem","există o problemă","eg-ZEES-tuh oh proh-BLEH-muh"],["there is no water","nu există apă","noo eg-ZEES-tuh AH-puh"]]},{"id":"present-tense","title":"Present tense","text":["The ending shows the person. A lucra (to work): lucrez, lucrezi, lucrează, lucrăm, lucrați, lucrează."],"rows":[["I work","lucrez","loo-KREZ"],["you work","lucrezi","loo-KREZ"],["he / she works","lucrează","loo-KRAH-zuh"],["we work","lucrăm","loo-KRUHM"],["you work (formal)","lucrați","loo-KRAHTS"],["they work","lucrează","loo-KRAH-zuh"]],"ex":[["I am eating bread","mănânc pâine","muh-NUHNK PUH-ee-neh"],["you are reading a book","citești o carte","chee-TESHT oh KAR-teh"],["she works in a bank","lucrează la bancă","loo-KRAH-zuh lah BAHN-kuh"],["we drink tea","bem ceai","bem chy"],["they are sleeping","dorm","dorm"]]},{"id":"basic-sentences","title":"Basic sentences","text":["The usual order is who, verb, what, but Romanian is flexible. The article goes after the noun: carte (a book), cartea (the book)."],"rows":[["I read a book","citesc o carte","chee-TESK oh KAR-teh"],["she drinks tea","ea bea ceai","yah byah chy"],["we go to school","mergem la școală","MER-jem lah shkoh-AH-luh"]],"ex":[["I read a book","citesc o carte","chee-TESK oh KAR-teh"],["he drinks tea","el bea ceai","el byah chy"],["we go to school","mergem la școală","MER-jem lah shkoh-AH-luh"],["they eat bread","mănâncă pâine","muh-NUHN-kuh PUH-ee-neh"],["the teacher writes","profesorul scrie","proh-feh-SOH-rool SKREE-eh"]]},{"id":"negation","title":"Negation","text":["Put \"nu\" before the verb: merg (I go), nu merg (I do not go)."],"rows":[["I go","merg","merg"],["I do not go","nu merg","noo merg"],["is","este","YES-teh"],["is not","nu este","noo YES-teh"]],"ex":[["I want","vreau","vryah-oo"],["I do not want","nu vreau","noo vryah-oo"],["I speak English","vorbesc engleza","vor-BESK en-GLEH-zah"],["I do not speak English","nu vorbesc engleza","noo vor-BESK en-GLEH-zah"],["I like it","îmi place","uhm PLAH-cheh"],["I do not like it","nu îmi place","noo uhm PLAH-cheh"],["she is here","ea este aici","yah YES-teh ah-EECH"],["she is not here","ea nu este aici","yah noo YES-teh ah-EECH"],["I have a car","am o mașină","ahm oh mah-SHEE-nuh"],["I do not have a car","nu am mașină","noo ahm mah-SHEE-nuh"],["I understand","înțeleg","uhn-tseh-LEG"],["I do not understand","nu înțeleg","noo uhn-tseh-LEG"],["we are tired","suntem obosiți","soon-TEM oh-boh-SEETS"],["we are not tired","nu suntem obosiți","noo soon-TEM oh-boh-SEETS"],["he works on Sundays","lucrează duminica","loo-KRAH-zuh doo-MEE-nee-kah"],["he does not work on Sundays","nu lucrează duminica","noo loo-KRAH-zuh doo-MEE-nee-kah"]]},{"id":"asking-questions","title":"Asking questions","text":["The word order does not change. Just raise your voice at the end. You can also start with \"oare\" for a softer question."],"rows":[["you are a student","ești student"],["are you a student?","ești student?"],["he is here","este aici"],["is he here?","este aici?"]],"ex":[["is this your book?","aceasta este cartea ta?","ah-CHAH-stah YES-teh KAR-tyah tah"],["are they here?","sunt aici?","soont ah-EECH"],["do you like tea?","îți place ceaiul?","uhts PLAH-cheh CHAH-yool"],["is it cold?","este frig?","YES-teh freeg"],["do you speak English?","vorbiți engleza?","vor-BEETS en-GLEH-zah"]]},{"id":"question-words","title":"Question words","text":["Question words stand at the start of the sentence."],"rows":[["what","ce","cheh"],["who","cine","CHEE-neh"],["where","unde","OON-deh"],["when","când","kuhnd"],["why","de ce","deh cheh"],["how","cum","koom"],["how much","cât","kuht"],["which","care","KAH-reh"]],"ex":[["what is your name?","cum te cheamă?","koom teh KYAH-muh"],["who is he?","cine este el?","CHEE-neh YES-teh el"],["where do you live?","unde locuiești?","OON-deh loh-kwee-ESHT"],["when is the lesson?","când este ora?","kuhnd YES-teh OH-rah"],["why are you late?","de ce ai întârziat?","deh cheh eye uhn-tuhr-zee-AHT"],["how much is it?","cât costă?","kuht KOS-tuh"],["which book?","care carte?","KAH-reh KAR-teh"]]},{"id":"possessives-and-liking","title":"Possessives and liking","text":["The word comes after the noun and agrees with it: cartea mea (my book), cartea ta (your book), cartea lui (his), cartea ei (her), cartea noastră (our), cartea voastră (your, formal), cartea lor (their). To like something, say \"îmi place\"."],"rows":[["my book","cartea mea","KAR-tyah myah"],["your book","cartea ta","KAR-tyah tah"],["his / her book","cartea lui / cartea ei","KAR-tyah looy / KAR-tyah ey"],["our book","cartea noastră","KAR-tyah NWAH-struh"],["your book (formal)","cartea dumneavoastră","KAR-tyah doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"]],"ex":[["my phone","telefonul meu","teh-leh-FOH-nool meh-oo"],["your house (formal)","casa dumneavoastră","KAH-sah doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"],["his sister","sora lui","SOH-rah looy"],["I like music","îmi place muzica","uhm PLAH-cheh MOO-zee-kah"],["I love football","iubesc fotbalul","yoo-BESK foht-BAH-lool"]]},{"id":"formal-vs-informal","title":"Formal vs informal","text":["tu (informal): friends, family, children. dumneavoastră / voi (formal): strangers, older people, work. The verb changes: -i (informal), -ți (formal)."],"rows":[["how are you?","ce mai faci? / ce mai faceți?","cheh my fahch / cheh my fah-CHETS"],["you speak","vorbești / vorbiți","vor-BESHT / vor-BEETS"],["your name","numele tău / numele dumneavoastră","NOO-meh-leh tuh-oo / NOO-meh-leh doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"]],"ex":[["how are you? (informal)","ce mai faci?","cheh my fahch"],["how are you? (formal)","ce mai faceți?","cheh my fah-CHETS"],["where are you going? (informal)","unde mergi?","OON-deh merj"],["where are you going? (formal)","unde mergeți?","OON-deh mer-JETS"],["please sit down (formal)","luați loc, vă rog","loo-AH-tsee lohk, vuh rohg"]]},{"id":"past-and-future-simple","title":"Past and future (simple)","text":["Past: \"am\" + the participle: am mers (I went). Future: \"voi\" + the basic verb, or \"o să\": voi merge, o să merg."],"rows":[["I went","am mers","ahm mers"],["you went","ai mers","eye mers"],["he went","a mers","ah mers"],["we went","am mers","ahm mers"]],"ex":[["yesterday I was tired","ieri am fost obosit","yehr ahm fohst oh-boh-SEET"],["I will study tomorrow","mâine o să studiez","MUH-ee-neh oh suh stoo-dee-EZ"],["we went to the park","am mers în parc","ahm mers uhn park"],["I saw him","l-am văzut","luhm vuh-ZOOT"],["she wrote a letter","a scris o scrisoare","ah skrees oh skree-SWAH-reh"]]},{"id":"commands","title":"Commands","text":["Informal: the short form (vino). Formal and plural: add -ți (veniți). To forbid, put \"nu\" in front: nu veni."],"rows":[["come (informal)","vino","VEE-noh"],["come (formal)","veniți","veh-NEETS"],["do not come","nu veni","noo veh-NEE"],["sit down","stai jos","stye zhohs"]],"ex":[["come here","vino aici","VEE-noh ah-EECH"],["do not come here","nu veni aici","noo veh-NEE ah-EECH"],["sit down","stai jos","stye zhohs"],["do not sit down","nu sta jos","noo stah zhohs"],["be quiet","taci","TAH-chee"],["do not be late","nu întârzia","noo uhn-tuhr-zee-AH"],["open the door","deschide ușa","des-KEE-deh OO-shah"],["close the window","închide fereastra","uhn-KEE-deh feh-RYAHS-trah"],["listen to me","ascultă-mă","ahs-KOOL-tuh-muh"],["do not worry","nu te îngrijora","noo teh uhn-gree-zhoh-RAH"],["speak slowly","vorbește rar","vor-BESH-teh rar"],["wait a moment","așteaptă un moment","ahsh-TYAHP-tuh oon moh-MENT"]]},{"id":"can-must-want","title":"Can, must, want","text":["A putea (can): pot să. A trebui (must): trebuie să. A vrea (want): vreau să. The second verb is in the \"să\" form."],"rows":[["I can swim","pot să înot"],["I cannot swim","nu pot să înot"],["I must go","trebuie să merg"],["I want to go","vreau să merg"]],"ex":[["I can swim","pot să înot","poht suh uh-NOHT"],["I cannot swim","nu pot să înot","noo poht suh uh-NOHT"],["can you help me?","mă puteți ajuta?","muh poo-TETS ah-zhoo-TAH"],["we must go","trebuie să mergem","treh-BWEE-eh suh MER-jem"],["we must not go","nu trebuie să mergem","noo treh-BWEE-eh suh MER-jem"],["I want to eat","vreau să mănânc","vryah-oo suh muh-NUHNK"],["I do not want to eat","nu vreau să mănânc","noo vryah-oo suh muh-NUHNK"],["you can come","poți să vii","pohts suh vee"],["you cannot come","nu poți să vii","noo pohts suh vee"],["she wants to study","ea vrea să studieze","yah vryah suh stoo-dee-EH-zeh"],["I must work today","trebuie să lucrez azi","treh-BWEE-eh suh loo-KREZ ahz"],["you must not run","nu trebuie să alergi","noo treh-BWEE-eh suh ah-LER-jee"]]},{"id":"in-on-at","title":"In, on, at","text":["Common words: în (in), pe (on), la (at, to), de la (from), cu (with), sub (under), lângă (next to)."],"rows":[["in","în","uhn"],["on","pe","peh"],["at / to","la","lah"],["from","de la","deh lah"]],"ex":[["the book is on the table","cartea este pe masă","KAR-tyah YES-teh peh MAH-suh"],["the cat is under the table","pisica este sub masă","pee-SEE-kah YES-teh soob MAH-suh"],["I am at school","sunt la școală","soont lah shkoh-AH-luh"],["I am at home","sunt acasă","soont ah-KAH-suh"],["the shop is next to the bank","magazinul este lângă bancă","mah-gah-ZEE-nool YES-teh LUHN-guh BAHN-kuh"],["the park is near the station","parcul este aproape de gară","PAR-kool YES-teh ah-proh-AH-peh deh GAH-ruh"],["we meet in the morning","ne întâlnim dimineața","neh uhn-tuhl-NEEM dee-mee-NYAH-tsah"],["the lesson is at nine","ora este la nouă","OH-rah YES-teh lah NOH-uh"],["the key is in the bag","cheia este în geantă","KAY-ah YES-teh uhn JAHN-tuh"]]},{"id":"comparing-things","title":"Comparing things","text":["Put \"mai\" before the adjective for \"more\": mai mare. For \"the most\" use \"cel mai\": cel mai mare. \"Than\" is \"decât\"."],"rows":[["big, bigger, the biggest","mare, mai mare, cel mai mare"],["small, smaller, the smallest","mic, mai mic, cel mai mic"]],"ex":[["big, bigger, the biggest","mare, mai mare, cel mai mare","MAH-reh my MAH-reh chel my MAH-reh"],["small, smaller, the smallest","mic, mai mic, cel mai mic","meek my meek chel my meek"],["this is better than that","acesta este mai bun decât acela","ah-CHES-tah YES-teh my boon deh-KUHT ah-CHEH-lah"],["this is worse than that","acesta este mai rău decât acela","ah-CHES-tah YES-teh my ruh-oo deh-KUHT ah-CHEH-lah"],["she is taller than me","ea este mai înaltă decât mine","yah YES-teh my uh-NAHL-tuh deh-KUHT MEE-neh"],["Tashkent is bigger than Samarkand","Tașkent este mai mare decât Samarkand","tahsh-KENT YES-teh my MAH-reh deh-KUHT sah-mar-KAHND"],["it is the cheapest","este cel mai ieftin","YES-teh chel my YEF-teen"],["the same as","la fel ca","lah fel kah"]]},{"id":"everyday-sentences","title":"Everyday sentences","text":["Quick sentences to copy and change."],"rows":[],"ex":[["he is a teacher","el este profesor","el YES-teh proh-FEH-sor"],["you (plural) are students","voi sunteți studenți","voy soon-TETS stoo-DENTS"],["I am happy","sunt fericit","soont feh-ree-CHEET"],["she is at school","ea este la școală","yah YES-teh lah shkoh-AH-luh"],["you are my friend","ești prietenul meu","esht pree-eh-TEH-nool meh-oo"],["it is cold","este frig","YES-teh freeg"],["I study English","studiez engleza","stoo-dee-EZ en-GLEH-zah"],["he teaches maths","el predă matematică","el PREH-duh mah-teh-MAH-tee-kuh"],["they work every day","lucrează în fiecare zi","loo-KRAH-zuh uhn fee-eh-KAH-reh zee"],["is this your book?","aceasta este cartea dumneavoastră?","ah-CHAH-stah YES-teh KAR-tyah doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"],["are they here?","sunt aici?","soont ah-EECH"],["do you like tea?","vă place ceaiul?","vuh PLAH-cheh CHAH-yool"],["what time is it?","cât este ceasul?","kuht YES-teh CHAH-sool"],["whose book is this?","a cui este această carte?","ah kwee YES-teh ah-CHAHS-tuh KAR-teh"],["how old are you?","câți ani ai?","kuhts ahn eye"],["how do you say it?","cum se spune?","koom seh SPOO-neh"],["your book (formal)","cartea dumneavoastră","KAR-tyah doom-nyah-VWAHS-truh"],["their house","casa lor","KAH-sah lor"],["my phone","telefonul meu","teh-leh-FOH-nool meh-oo"],["excuse me, sir","scuzați-mă, domnule","skoo-ZAH-tsee-muh, DOHM-noo-leh"],["please sit down (formal)","luați loc, vă rog","loo-AH-tsee lohk, vuh rohg"],["come here (informal)","vino aici","VEE-noh ah-EECH"],["yesterday I was tired","ieri am fost obosit","yehr ahm fohst oh-boh-SEET"],["I will study tomorrow","mâine o să studiez","MUH-ee-neh oh suh stoo-dee-EZ"],["we went to the park","am mers în parc","ahm mers uhn park"]]}],"name":"Romanian","id":"ro","flag":"ro","note":""}